7:["$","section","Human Psychology, Summer Business Courses, and Language Courses – Bishop’s University ( 1 year )",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Human Psychology, Summer Business Courses, and Language Courses – Bishop’s University ( 1 year )"}],[["$","p","Financial Accounting-I, Medical Office Administration, Pharmacy Assistant-CIMT College ( 5 months)",{"children":"Financial Accounting-I, Medical Office Administration, Pharmacy Assistant-CIMT College ( 5 months)"}],["$","p","The United Kingdom stands out as a leading nation in providing excellent education, featuring a wider array of innovative courses than other countries, including short term courses. Numerous students opt for short-term courses or summer schools to study in the UK, seeking first-hand experience of the UK’s renowned education system.",{"children":"The United Kingdom stands out as a leading nation in providing excellent education, featuring a wider array of innovative courses than other countries, including short term courses. Numerous students opt for short-term courses or summer schools to study in the UK, seeking first-hand experience of the UK’s renowned education system."}],["$","p","Check out the below 5 summer programs in UK:",{"children":"Check out the below 5 summer programs in UK:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","UNITED KINGDOM:",{"children":"UNITED KINGDOM:"}]]}]]}]
8:["$","section","Beginners in a specific language: University of Westminster ( 2 months)",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Beginners in a specific language: University of Westminster ( 2 months)"}],[["$","p","Top 5 benefits for international students who are planning summer programs are:",{"children":"Top 5 benefits for international students who are planning summer programs are:"}],["$","p","Earn extra credits in less time:",{"children":"Earn extra credits in less time:"}],["$","p","Studying abroad in the summer can help you stand out from the competition in addition to being an interesting and enjoyable method to get your degree. During the summer semester, gaining extra credits can allow you to enroll in interesting classes outside of your major or go through your course more quickly.",{"children":"Studying abroad in the summer can help you stand out from the competition in addition to being an interesting and enjoyable method to get your degree. During the summer semester, gaining extra credits can allow you to enroll in interesting classes outside of your major or go through your course more quickly."}],["$","p","Receive more attention in smaller classes:",{"children":"Receive more attention in smaller classes:"}],["$","p","Smaller class sizes provide opportunities for hands-on learning and interactions between students and teachers, as opposed to enormous lecture halls where you’re just a body in a seat.Perhaps more excitingly, you could study abroad under the guidance of a professor who is conducting a special kind of research in the field—something you would never be able to do on campus or in a fall or spring program.",{"children":"Smaller class sizes provide opportunities for hands-on learning and interactions between students and teachers, as opposed to enormous lecture halls where you’re just a body in a seat.Perhaps more excitingly, you could study abroad under the guidance of a professor who is conducting a special kind of research in the field—something you would never be able to do on campus or in a fall or spring program."}],["$","p","Get a chance to meet diverse student groups:",{"children":"Get a chance to meet diverse student groups:"}],["$","p","Summer programs attract a larger student body than more “traditional” fall or spring programs because they are open to students worldwide. Being unrestricted by the academic year or college credit modules, summer programs also offer the freedom to concentrate on alternative subjects. There are numerous ways to do this.",{"children":"Summer programs attract a larger student body than more “traditional” fall or spring programs because they are open to students worldwide. Being unrestricted by the academic year or college credit modules, summer programs also offer the freedom to concentrate on alternative subjects. There are numerous ways to do this."}],["$","p","Spend less money than last semester:",{"children":"Spend less money than last semester:"}],["$","p","Some students think studying abroad is beyond their reach due to the cost but one of the perks of going overseas during the summer is that you can knock out multiple credits under one program fee.",{"children":"Some students think studying abroad is beyond their reach due to the cost but one of the perks of going overseas during the summer is that you can knock out multiple credits under one program fee."}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"],"$L21"]}]
