1a:["$","p","Overcome your travel anxiety with a shorter program:",{"children":"Overcome your travel anxiety with a shorter program:"}]
1b:["$","p","Study abroad programs in the summer could be overwhelming for first-time visitors who are unsure about their ability to adjust to the new environment but there are various programs to fit your needs, ranging in duration from a week to the whole summer.",{"children":"Study abroad programs in the summer could be overwhelming for first-time visitors who are unsure about their ability to adjust to the new environment but there are various programs to fit your needs, ranging in duration from a week to the whole summer."}]
1c:["$","p","Conclusion:",{"children":"Conclusion:"}]
1d:["$","p","Your dreams of learning abroad and spending the summer abroad can come true thanks to programs that connect people from all over the world. It can be scary to study abroad, so make sure you have all the things you need if you’ve never been abroad before. In this case, short-term classes might be helpful.",{"children":"Your dreams of learning abroad and spending the summer abroad can come true thanks to programs that connect people from all over the world. It can be scary to study abroad, so make sure you have all the things you need if you’ve never been abroad before. In this case, short-term classes might be helpful."}]
1e:["$","p","You will be able to experience what it’s like to study abroad without having to carry too much. If you receive acceptance, don’t pass up the opportunity to study abroad for a brief period. Get ready for an exciting adventure! Even though it’s only for a short time, there will be a lot of work to do and beautiful sights to see. If you are still anxious or feeling stuck on how to move forward,you can always reach out to our experts at",{"children":"You will be able to experience what it’s like to study abroad without having to carry too much. If you receive acceptance, don’t pass up the opportunity to study abroad for a brief period. Get ready for an exciting adventure! Even though it’s only for a short time, there will be a lot of work to do and beautiful sights to see. If you are still anxious or feeling stuck on how to move forward,you can always reach out to our experts at"}]
